{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 662,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37aa46981ea3f6a3e491a056",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心像总是存在于我的心中──\\n……而它正缓缓地燃烧着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d669c17abab7b37e332999851a2d33e77582c2ead5678064c0cd5917438432",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "455"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a7cbdc233733e1464600d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃点心。因为能量转换效率很高，\\n最适合作为燃料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a98468c0b8ced9be18c96eba9bfeea5e38e134f7c04594da1dd4eff3e319ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "456"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fdf035f09c990f89419d8b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……那是机密。\\n我无法回答这个问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd1506dd9c60780885b56f25592d3183d09369e163a521b5659fd380af3d9faa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "457"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a82d68c9cc033f67f765254",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我判断那是「会令人高兴」的评价。\\n谢谢你的赞美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe6cce18076c87fc4c1a1b81c796c6eb6693760495772a63db0a2a317489d6c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "458"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d204d8d8ecd1635c96c17ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不只是大小，就连肌肉的质量也很重要。\\n所以我会先和肌肉商量过后再决定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8f7f4ada16a15b60b37c4a0bcab8699fe369c8c573b8e5cb2a1760d1afdaa5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "459"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4e410ce890eb927ae4c5af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……嗯，也算是为了要减少空气阻力，\\n这是我必须要认真面对的难题呢……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64f14ab8d2ab90934efdc89e3fdaa2030cddb03e86283899d1fcc83d47336a7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0621f6951f8bbdebb438f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有仔细地做完缓和运动了，所以还好！\\n反而是我的心情还没有平静下来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2afa91b01336be31bbf30ef66b57546f803f4a69ecc7448854b6201906411639",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dccf2b7fc8b3da96b9244e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必我认识的那个人也会在场。\\n不过……正因如此，我会拿出全力喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70747687243921b311e0da58e069c9a6ddd8514e1bfea26e2c9f054b7bc091d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511232c277f01627eb9ba2f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢～如果我的表现能让谁的心情\\n变得Buono起来，那就让人再高兴不过了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ba49a018710bcbfd78e7558fbe964e17cdaf49b7b045be1d18b0c5bf8d693e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07afb899468a8dae0b19edb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，是指精神百倍相扑锅吗～？\\n我是用生姜和莲藕……咦？你是问练习的事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cbe607114b873638d9356825bd1a33cc32e81d0636b6763561146807f8b428a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "463"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be90eca5da0f31e9aa6f38a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多亏有大家的笑容和欢呼，我现在的心情\\n超级Buono的喔～♪Buono～Buono～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2264e45dbf18caec8bf26a73d76ab99e0fcb89676acca79f2a67e144d05a96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "464"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e4467f206727bdbb51ba16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是吗？耶嘿嘿，现在的我\\n说不定连星星都追得上呢……开玩笑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f2dd53ef64de360b543c7e436d13d1c898fd5af9a485ac5a0ce82893751901",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "465"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:982d91802dc5ce21b2c8088f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，今天的对手都是闪亮亮的\\n「都市女孩」……但我不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3a2b6c2c5ae66ba82b08ca2a5d6444c9e695bcb7b81b9e965decedaa5f5f07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "466"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae74b106e43da8d0adb72d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "故乡的大家都来帮我加油了！\\n他们也都有跟我说恭喜喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f462d4ee30060b7b33bf2785a1263c33a3abf2d26b9349a60ebc4f97097e98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "467"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6656597ae474c699e444aa1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦！那个、素的！我、我会努力的……\\n所以……还请看着我的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cedd091f8d8b0ca860b4392bc2b94a704e903018fa8fdb64019392a07734e43d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "468"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eac17047b7ea01a3730f851",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃，如果米浴的表现……可以让某个人\\n产生幸福感的话……那就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c12e86aad2c485a1b7ab2729f57fdc0e20aa665ba4a1a0ed4e0e15e72c233c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "469"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbc6102163c1c97c9c9410a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人家的闪电作战让你们看得目不转睛对吧？\\n下场竞赛也会让大家充满期待喔～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb2e86a8aafebcdb0cb7a5fef81f0fe60343ab9861bfa6467fa18d02154c2bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43e9e01ddad0fbb6eb8ad4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃，那个……我今天早上吃的是面包……\\n那个……非常好吃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f89038a871839a9da40a338bc400815330bae0aadef8fee20b17d653c349db82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "470"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85198165c08a8d367aa0fa1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这样的话我去带家人和训练员过来！\\n因为这是我跟大家一起摘下的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47435f0c8f2110943cf6605bce701bbcc972f4182f56a2a3d89f4b6664645374",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b841f0b84b3c34d5043806fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不会不会！毕竟每天累积下来的\\n训练成果比那个沉重多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9b6f8f901af3d3e85a9e7f69bde4fd5444f8862f44b510097fca5b5ccf5c02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "472"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7d739c98aa34a897a4db7d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼。你们还是把那个\\n温柔姐姐艾尼斯风神给忘掉会比较好喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "197a3a086d590a922f580a792d2f49da730d850074eaf209206bc1de4b447549",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "473"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02048656e0f4da711ce6f91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为透过今天的竞赛发现了能更进一步\\n改善的地方，所以我决定要立刻进行验证喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "030fab7ce6729698bc63aa84dac54a079705871dfa66f0f4670771cc4b162b89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "474"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3431ca0cada00d9d6c9b163",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……在你看来是那样的话，\\n那今天的实验应该能说是成功了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d98be0b890d581ccdaa3b6dbefeadfafa5a23c026efa9aef30c8317a8437e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "475"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed39ae882d99522a5a822813",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我体会到你们的声援也是让我展现出\\n今天这种表现的因子之一……很有意思呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eae375c89868a9b3a8e72c2c03f67d4898aecb97675b9ce78929548fd3a8b18",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "476"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b9b8df5dba5367d06994ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不打算去对其他人的表现说三道四。\\n毕竟我自己也不会想被人说三道四……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f04444c9e15c9e5badbdf288107cc55a86270e9f956f4a7d7419f8bc7916556",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "477"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d33d675929284e3bc228cd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……这跟我追求的明星光辉相比，\\n还远远不及。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fddb297b6b4dac2e4bad3c79396a7326ca26fe843546e292bb4c8de96b9e24d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "478"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af2e6f1043aae31db284d65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我会拿出不让一等星之名蒙羞的表现，\\n仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03fb7b5377e5bcec1993a6f5fe7ed77594cdc86dcfe62d161a011aba0dc4a54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "479"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3245cef71e05c34a3872f08f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想想喔～啊，不行不行！作战内容是\\n最高机密！好女人总是会有很多秘密的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc35c3e956c12bd74210de9f715430e3af325cfd17e19d22b926e06a96bb39a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b816a056635d5e10f01e8f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦！有把握到不行呢！期待会有像\\n三尺烟火球爆发那样盛大的赛况！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90c2c46df9afb287cd5621ce97e8504116fe42fed8b7e317e21efe71ca41e496",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "480"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2c0909f4e6197c1b33c63e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是场严禁分心的重大对决！\\n不能三心二意，只能专心看着我啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82513b33f71eadb69b6ff062a52ce8de598b1f6c2e01cf18e7ae680659aee44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e123dac629df59804bae072",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从「巅峰」俯瞰到的美景，\\n就由我稻荷大人独占啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ddaa7b04c3118b3055c42a9cc9bf2a67ab36631bf81f9a4cd010344ae2fe28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "482"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec53c67a1cef7e6d23d0a06b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我去和大家握手了！然后还说了\\n「之后要再一起跑喔──」这样！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2baec47a8de52b1b102d1d98e470b3172aa6fd2c6c676d3eb1a337f7849b67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "483"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3878d1472461c8388e39a391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耶──！太棒了──！！这样的心情！\\n下场竞赛我也会加油！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8fe396bf8bd39dcc8d8ac5435d458fe0e1a81112fafa9b08c8adb92dc84a08c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "484"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82c9c3cafa5a37e87e43029",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实我紧张到还做了个睡过头的梦……\\n不过因为最后赢了所以不要紧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "619d0ecedca1372fb8186bb212995615602fb700b86c84deeca8b0f351b22f52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "485"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a7a0fb92b1dbdd56495b22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这还用问吗？就跟模拟的结果\\n一样完美，所以才会赢啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d3b6e815ce5f84f29584950a0480aa867b00f711f8d22b81b88204081dd1b66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "486"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4120dfa6ee7b869adab8b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊？那种事跟你无关吧。\\n……就当作是我要回去睡觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "542a28dc13153b519e52b0fb3537e24af4779d90bfb1ff77144205f1b3548772",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "487"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ef9922b7c78131fc3e800c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啥？如果有那种闲工夫，\\n还不如重新去收集下场竞赛的数据咧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2ee4560832c68acaa9fd716e2fc9a27029bcf7e08b5302a221ee87a9e710cc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "488"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bb16662faef45602ae47eea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为位于故乡的双亲也预计会透过转播\\n收看决赛……所以我一定要获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8c627d44f7e02e299f34d6a2a306a97f78a6953b6ab253180c727bcce85f508",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "489"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6b1da8cc5ba9ec5153bc2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……因为「朋友」的影子\\n今天也舒展得很长的关系──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3dab5caf24dbce57def3a7e6065df3b0cd7572027251351baa8138741a8ba65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f70eca435ca8dc7399bf35b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，已经设定拿到优胜为止的计划。\\n到目前为止的规划也都顺利地完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b920ec174a8f522a1c5d9261f967a62599827a5399c6ca8cba1ca94f8c32e24f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "490"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d81dcfefaa39eeb5a45520",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作战详情是机密，所以我无法回答，\\n若是问到「规划」……Sieg──是要获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aa0bff6dfa1ecf50f37f6f3ef81173f713b68286f66f64f3161537a8f440aeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6873d9360f8269a51a2ddb43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，好高兴喔♪欸嘿，那是我跟队伍的成员们\\n要祈求必胜而去参拜时拍的照片☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61eb4a8164a2be109e90c027bb0adca77a6d15aaa89173315f393f2c106af26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "492"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b53b2808dded9fb1ad84162",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那可是秘、密喔☆有关作战之外的真机伶\\n相关信息正公开于UG上，要记得确认喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "90cc1bcc1f076533c6baf2cf5812343edc568146316f8ce04ccd18a808522589",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "493"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a7e950b1a2d76ad85c7e99a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿，终于发现真机伶有多么可爱了吗？\\n下次也会让你神魂颠倒，要做好觉悟喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a717cf5114492cdfad81238c9b628ccee3e3fcc218993a1b483e2e13dc4d9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "494"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca138dd8e0882e733ad8668",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "写成强敌念成「朋友」……\\n这样到底是有多少劲敌啊～！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed4e3f4c0a43f5e9a4c4ac3a88fee8f5d45298bd74810d4c8bf8f8576cec1c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "495"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a6920a3318c61fe53c311a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，因为训练员跟我约好，如果我赢了\\n就要用王子风格的方式为我庆祝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c095b6e71b3100a5a7a033dcd7c23982941fe6cc9ea8711941ba6c27babe8846",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "496"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587289529a6f5b52a4bffa0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会成为出色的公主并前去迎接你，\\n请把王冠洗干净等着我的到来吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c7abcf7051d4e1dd4e6a1deb91e1e0cb4de7bbb260cb59c5b7edfa4955f98fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "497"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133fb62efc55c15458eca1c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是当然的吧，毕竟是决赛。不过无所谓，\\n比赛时……我只会抱着必胜的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b4bc32e741b6c8a771936e19345e30ad69601925ffeac0fc36c12eb56534a25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "498"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:584a3cbb6e0582579d43ab14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我一定会赢。因为我会展现出让全场观众\\n都无法把视线从我身上移开的精彩表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2470e5ceb3cbfc66ce131f69c3517f1775e09506a9d4da9b89e5485cd7e0a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "499"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cb8e796af8f91a09a5577bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咿嘻嘻！没有问题，大家都是\\n名副其实的强敌，足以证明我的实力喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3007da93d64b43ad25971173230d3d60e9acb81041fb1229fd9698eda4ab4c71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7384268af979ae3aefc88f9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我昨晚在紫色的海里……转来转去，\\n追着水母然后就──天亮了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e05927ba83c6b3da10da8560ace949ea3c6d3e4bce75002cf8b57a93bfc9b55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac76e43fceee68d3c3d2a5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……应该是队伍成员偶尔会在早上\\n来叫我起床吧？老实说真的是帮了我大忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7acb46151185e9ae2a20ed8297e7eaa9a088c38f3b1f02bbe9b259a6c4908012",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df073e79dbdd237bc3f230c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错吧！没错吧！我身为\\n胜利班长也感到非常骄傲！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "237b7452ab4b3a3ccd620df39b07d8fcc2650a186b80520cd7152f6556f82e87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28fd5cd825029548a0b7ce03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊！因为我听说这样好像可以变成\\n超越爆进的「爆进涡轮」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ddf38f9f5de4ac68af74c189b7e67d691852cc470b25532894442dfb37c48a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343a4e0f6a1a71f70ea1009a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宣誓！我樱花进王发誓会堂堂正正\\n且如模范般地爆进获胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a14d43f6c3b83169da6ddf919c6388f0be3e10ecd2105af0af0662a5e5b1b3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:637e06904afd79b3d61a68c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Nice question呢。用一字回答是soul，\\n用两字就是burning soul～～唷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22d7f15a5524230729b9d145498734aee1b91c44834d7b8e29a4841c3d50adf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16915226e859419a28059d26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "牡蛎吃到饱……不对，还是留到final时\\n拿下victory的时候好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "811f06747cc6d7b093662eee5b48bb4b65315c8c474f0fe207cd42ed672a69d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffe67f4afb9533575fbf158a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不想看看吗？看看世界转变的瞬间──\\n如果想，就要look・at・me！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde7b30d92c0ad312953b0f309af64a1a7a2c2edad5d5c883f6861f3d46682b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5902c050b0e153a59827f4e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，风风会刷很久的牙。\\n这样就能尽情……用力咬紧牙了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a2b1164a5745564df1d2137a8d2b640a34a81cce4756c9490055ca5213f341",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c9f29850a84f5554691f97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想知道的话，就去做一本专属风风的杂志！\\n到时候风风再告诉你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d741c2d11401d689ddf7c3cbd3ce53ddb4c4065c50996c921bbf900460c9e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36064b5e1018646214da5b81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这样就算受瞩目了！？根本完全不够啦！\\n不来现场声援的人都要被风风用力咬──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "139d667a6bb26f1779073f066ecc74521fb83a0654209b1d255537b5e36bffb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d356e21d5f60beb6d79e540a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "预计会在下场比赛前，\\n分析这次竞赛的数据并完成更新。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7b6cca521ee9843aeec9c49d7d52395382b9c811708d4af42571afb90049fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:223228175b760e70a127eb1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然啰！毕竟我那么努力了耶！\\n……好啦，使魔偶尔也是能派上用场的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "137918dfe45bf2a0c16a47b617e4d06162535ae1d5c7ddea357e41fd9f6afd7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "510"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e458cd82a5cdeaa71752a499",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "高兴过头啦！明明还有决赛耶！\\n大家真～的好傻好天真对吧！呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42bb762a48122eca2239111d0ac9376aa18858dfce232cd786ba11825203b3d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:466732939e2ea82e2297d473",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会在竞赛中让使魔传输魔力给我喔！\\n所以我还要给他喉糖，让他能尽全力工作！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ded62930089ef368fff4f59c45f3a578ece45e5aef30cb0bc60d91aae23d82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "512"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8791e27c3402835294ae0032",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各位的声援当中都有着\\n会让我打起精神的强大力量喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e9d87474d1e45385b7b702d895cb234026549b198929bc9cb58036650259ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422343fd0db62315b55e7eec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，不管是实力有多强的对手，我都会\\n好好地「疼爱」她们喔～开玩笑的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef849a6989788de0a06edbb383adf10746195b1f2e2bea89f83a159c44ac1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5310e64a4a6ddc1b611b074a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那就让训练员，还有队伍的大家\\n向我撒娇，来当作「奖励」吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "030454f6aaddf7060c75cb687e022f2cbdf903680fd6f83c3b7a4d2f1efccb3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "515"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bd63b1d2cd7d4c671972b30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不会让出来☆欸嘿，不小心就宣战了……\\n要好好期待胜者舞台喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81174aece75c0dd5b1b536b4fb4ce42e0837b20c79f02975b54e72e87e295349",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "516"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60cccb3ae003adaf20eb3cbb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不论对手是谁……我都会领先到底♪\\n会让你们见识到赛马娘偶像的实力喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "25caa0fe16c1680289b5adb8c085f8bd2175f51ec41e5600d7f3612440725b5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "517"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43cec7724dea9a85a9146c68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦？真、真的吗？很帅……\\n我很帅……欸嘿嘿，总觉得好害羞喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cb12dee17fd02d1bb728a3798e866a3e459b50fd006fad89c877cc7eb6d668",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "518"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb125a0eec0be2c0d25c5fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个，我是很典型的文组，对概率什么的……\\n例如跟点P相关的问题我也、就是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbcf23ae7db8a3f30bdeb2ee30732c03314da0853b9a0b7dbf551bfc449088ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "519"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e274e8e23084ee389d583b1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是因为前几天更换了新的零件……\\n我开玩笑的。真要说的话是因为「努力」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20d94ed03b154a459079e293090fad8e94b6036d4d7d3e8a6a7fbba89376457e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b97cfa538118555efeac2d68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实我昨天和室友吃了求胜的炸猪排盖饭……\\n呵呵，当时米浴真的很厉害喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99902e429d082a72523cc8512e447d7ad50b87eb091244c555fcb3d294ee483",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "520"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1de758aa1144fab4fecd9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相对来说应该算是比较冷静、吧！\\n也有余力注意场地状态跟自己的步伐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8f32042f808de0f6851155dfd58fc2b9160132567264517977c76ff243888b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b9e8053ebee5eead85095c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然！是说我一直都是用这种心态去跑的，\\n没开玩笑，所以你就看着吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf32c907a2ce96dc3c46ed0667e2cb5a885dbbc1509943d5cdef26cbb02009f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "522"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426cad5849f0a9d38280fe78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦？好犹豫。果然是死党吧？欧耶～！\\n我赢啰～下次去唱歌时要多奉承我啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e167e55ad9d6bc2aef67e497bfd0e66ea273e2b7ac1aaef6ca5c6d3386808562",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "523"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c8833f8a98aa12a11d5eea7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气球……？虽然听不懂，但会用最显眼的吧。\\n啊，是说你也拍一下我的美甲嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08bb25265755130ce9c0ab977d6f08d9c700df63bb4dba11c9f36303eaa731ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "524"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d05c34539d454318b3b5027",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也许吧……薄荷味很棒喔。\\n你也要吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cc824877b531c724f794e6342b7e34fe6c8b96faf67c0032082165977d09c11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "525"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8fdf2be6c4ddeac92fbdfce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是一场很刺激的比赛……就这样而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb7d8cb5fadf5343f4aed98fef7a85c80d94a1d86237780f672a5c82e836797",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "526"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
